  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Process support and formulation of a revised Strategic Sector Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In light of the priorities of the Danish Government&#x2019;s new strategies, in particular the Development Policy Strategy and Global Climate Action Strategy, and to incorporate lessons learnt since 2015 a process is initiated to develop new guiding principles for the Danish Strategic Sector Collaboration. Moreover, the new Guiding Principles will also reflect the Government&#x2019;s ambitious priorities for Danish Development Policy in relation to the green transition.</narrative>
  </description>
